Brand marks
-----------

src/components/brand.tsx draws GitHub's mark, on the links to the source code,
and Google's "G", on the "Continue with Google" button as Google's sign-in
branding guidelines ask. Both are their owners' trademarks, used only to name
their services. The Insulin Apps mark is the "l" of the Insulin wordmark.
